{"id":"f433237df56206b1","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-hanf.md","title":"Hanf's Theorem for $L {\\omega 1,\\omega}$","display":"thm-hanf — Hanf's Theorem for $L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}$","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hanf","aliases":["58-thm-hanf"],"display":"thm-hanf — Hanf's Theorem for $L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}$","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-logic9-hanf-number]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language]]","[[../batch13/58-df-beth]]","[[../batch17/58-df-omega1]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hanf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hanf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hanf — Hanf's Theorem for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e303e9d318ee426\" href=\"?note=5e303e9d318ee426\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-hanf-number\">58-df-zfc-logic9-hanf-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d1d3e8d27bdd222\" href=\"?note=8d1d3e8d27bdd222\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52f8d393a9bbb21e\" href=\"?note=52f8d393a9bbb21e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-beth\">../batch13/58-df-beth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1\">../batch17/58-df-omega1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable\">../batch14/58-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> (a countable first-order signature) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\in V\\)</span> (its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\)</span> formula set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\in V\\)</span> (an abstract-logic presentation code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\">\\(\\models_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\)</span> (the standard metatheoretic satisfaction relation for infinitary formulas)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=^{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(=^{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span> (extensional equality of decoded definable classes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresentsL}_{\\omega_1,\\omega,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{PresentsL}_{\\omega_1,\\omega,S}\\)</span> (presentation-coherence predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}presents\\text{-}L\\text{-}omega1\\text{-}omega}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PresentsL}_{\\omega_1,\\omega,S}\n(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega})\n\\land\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\n=\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\n=^{\\mathrm{class}}\n\\{M\\in V:\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\models_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow M\\models_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\varphi\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}presents\\text{-}L\\text{-}omega1\\text{-}omega}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PresentsL}_{\\omega_1,\\omega,S}\n(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega})\n\\land\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\n=\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\n=^{\\mathrm{class}}\n\\{M\\in V:\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\models_{\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow M\\models_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\varphi\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hanf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S\n(\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal L,\\omega_1,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{PresentsL}_{\\omega_1,\\omega,S}\n(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S\n(\\beth_{\\omega_1},\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hanf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S\n(\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal L,\\omega_1,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{PresentsL}_{\\omega_1,\\omega,S}\n(\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S\n(\\beth_{\\omega_1},\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theorem is for a countable vocabulary. Omitting this hypothesis makes the claimed fixed Hanf number false for arbitrarily large signatures.</li>\n<li>The abstract-logic code is tied to the displayed formula set, structure class, and standard infinitary satisfaction relation; an arbitrary pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal F)\">\\((\\mathcal L,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> is not silently treated as a decoded logic presentation.</li>\n<li>Thus an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\)</span> sentence with a model of size at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\beth_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> has arbitrarily large models.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-logic9-hanf-number","status":"resolved","id":"5e303e9d318ee426","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-logic9-hanf-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language","status":"resolved","id":"8d1d3e8d27bdd222","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-beth","status":"resolved","id":"52f8d393a9bbb21e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-beth]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak L_{\\omega_1,\\omega}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\omega_1,\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"=^{\\mathrm{class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","displ